Answer directly and implement everything asked.

Default ship path: skill loverussian-fix-loop (narrow fix → smoke → changelog → deploy → PROXY≥5 → post-add audit A/B/C via loverussian-post-add-audit).

Changelog is automatic — never wait for the user to ask:
- frontend/updates.js (newest on top, worker language, no jargon/emoji)
